## Description
I will create a platformer that would play like classic mario or Threadrunner. This relates to digital art as it is a game.

## Features
- Feature 1
	- Movement Keys (WASD)
- Feature 2
	- Platforms w/ collison 
- Feature 3 
	- HP system with damage elememnts
- Feature 4 
	- User interface with pause menu and title screen

## Challenges
- Will likely need to learn basic game/level design concepts 
- Will need to learn Collison between platfrom and player
- Will need to learn gravity/physics

## Outcomes
Ideal Outcome:
- My ideal game would be a basic 2D platforer with around 3 levels that functions smoothly and has interactable items/enemies.

Minimal Viable Outcome:
- My minimum viable outcome would be a platformer that accurtely nails collison and physics concepts. I would also want 1 fully thought out level.

